[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2601020152","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101804#issuecomment-2601020152","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101804","id":2601020152,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bCGr4","user":{"login":"RitleDev","id":89964227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5OTY0MjI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89964227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RitleDev","html_url":"https://github.com/RitleDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RitleDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RitleDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RitleDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RitleDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RitleDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RitleDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RitleDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RitleDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RitleDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-19T21:01:14Z","updated_at":"2025-01-19T21:01:14Z","body":"Hello 😊, I got the same error on **Windows 11** with your project.\nLambdas don't seem to make this error appear **on their own**, they need to **exist inside function call** for it to occur.\n\nFor example, this does not output an error:\n``` gdscript\nfunc example() -> void:\n\tprint(\"hello world\")\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tdraw.connect(\n\t\texample\n\t)\n```\nNor does this:\n``` gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar hello_func = func():\n\t\tprint('hello world')\n```\n\nA more generic case of this error can look like this (This does result the error appearing again):\n``` gdscript\nfunc my_func(lambda_parameter: Callable):\n\tlambda_parameter.call()\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tmy_func(func():\n\t\tprint('hello world')\n\t)\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2601020152/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603384714","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101804#issuecomment-2603384714","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101804","id":2603384714,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bLH-K","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T00:04:26Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T00:04:26Z","body":"Looked into this a bit, the error seems to be from an extra `Token::DEDENT` when `Token::TK_EOF` is expected after parsing the script.  The `gdscript_tokenizer.cpp` change in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100550 fixes the issue for me ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603384714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603402598","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101804#issuecomment-2603402598","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101804","id":2603402598,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bLMVm","user":{"login":"coppolaemilio","id":2206700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDY3MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2206700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio","html_url":"https://github.com/coppolaemilio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coppolaemilio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T00:26:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T00:26:42Z","body":"Nice! Wasn't able to find the other issue. Thanks for linking to the PR @aaronp64 \nClosing because it is a duplicate of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/96228","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603402598/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"p